      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} It doesn't work from the website; there's nothing I can do to make it work. If I try to do it from the in-game shop, I get an error message saying that the owner cannot give away their own product from the shop. \n\nAll you had to do was add an option from the marketplace menu on the website dashboard to be able to donate a copy of the avatar to a user.",
