      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{690b1b1a4f8511f380f847c5|full_name} Thank you for pointing that out!\n\nYou can buy avatars from the world stores of certain avatar creators. For example:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0766796f-4af6-415f-9662-fb3bd8b4ff41/store\n\nHowever, the avatar marketplace is currently not available on VRChat.com, and you can't view avatar listings directly.\n\nI created a feature request for buying (and gifting) avatars through the website: https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace/p/allow-users-to-view-and-buy-avatar-listings-on-vrchatcom\n\nSeparately, avatar sellers requested the ability to gift their own avatars to other users. This feature request is tracked on our seller feedback board: https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace-sellers/p/gift-your-own-avatars-free-to-people",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
