  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-05-22T12:50:26.415Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Add a gifting feature that allows users to buy avatars for other users.\n\nThough this idea was already discussed in the FAQ thread in the forum ( https://ask.vrchat.com/t/avatar-marketplace-faq-for-sellers/43555 )\n\n```\n\nQ: What about gifting avatars? (Asked by @Hammey)\n\nA: Not yet, but it’s a popular feature request and we’d like to do it.\n\n```\n\n, I will post this as a reminder and voting place.",
